{"title": "Parliamentary Committees reshuffle: TMC loses chairperson posts", "summary": "The Trinamool Congress (TMC) has lost the chairpersonship of two key Parliamentary Committees. The Parliamentary Committee on Commerce, previously headed by TMC Rajya Sabha MP Dola Sen, will now be led by BJP Rajya Sabha MP Sudhanshu Trivedi.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "संसदीय समितियों में फेरबदल: टीएमसी ने अध्यक्ष पद खोए", "summary_hi": "तृणमूल कांग्रेस (टीएमसी) ने दो महत्वपूर्ण संसदीय समितियों की अध्यक्षता खो दी है। वाणिज्य पर संसदीय समिति, जिसकी अध्यक्षता पहले टीएमसी के राज्यसभा सांसद डोला सेन कर रही थीं, अब भाजपा के राज्यसभा सांसद सु ด้านशु त्रिवेदी के नेतृत्व में होगी।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Reported the reshuffle of parliamentary committee chairperson posts, noting the TMC's loss of two such positions.", "Specified that the Commerce Committee, previously chaired by TMC MP Dola Sen, has been assigned to BJP MP Sudhanshu Trivedi."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["संसदीय समिति के अध्यक्ष पदों पर फेरबदल की सूचना दी, जिसमें टीएमसी द्वारा दो ऐसे पदों के खोने का उल्लेख किया गया।", "यह निर्दिष्ट किया कि वाणिज्य समिति, जिसकी अध्यक्षता पहले टीएमसी सांसद डोला सेन कर रही थीं, अब भाजपा सांसद सु ด้านशु त्रिवेदी को सौंपी गई है।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/10/dola-sen-kirti-azad-express-photo-1.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Indian Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/india/parliamentary-standing-committees-reshuffle-trinamool-congress-loses-chairperson-berths-derek-obrien-letter-sudhanshu-trivedi-10905581", "headline": "Parliamentary Committees reshuffle: TMC loses both chairperson posts"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Trinamool Congress loses chairpersonship of 2 key Parliamentar